# Web3Forms access key — powers the "Notify Me" signup (components/Newsletter,
# components/NewsletterPopup) and the checkout reservation email.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the key from https://web3forms.com/
# .env.local is gitignored; this example file is not, so never put the real
# key here.
#
# Without it the forms render normally but refuse to submit, logging a warning
# naming this variable rather than silently appearing to succeed.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
